Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me...   Oh, the Sky of the planet Aquarius!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"As long as people live on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...the creation is going to last forever."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"So Please help them live their lives to the fullest."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Then the creation shall have a beautiful and glimmering radiance, depending on your will alone."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"Then, the life shall possess a beautiful radiance."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Then, the radiance of life...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,shall beautify the people and their bonds they share with each other."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do not ever forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.89,0:07:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That, "The universe is but the life itself and everything is connected, for all eternity."
